### 1. Create Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Account",
  "initialCash": 20000
}


### 2. Set AAPL Price = $100
POST http://localhost:8080/api/market/prices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "price": 100
}


### 3. Buy 10 AAPL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 10
}


### 4. Check Currently Held Symbols
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dividends/held-symbols


### 5. Sync Dividends For Currently Held Symbols
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dividends/sync-held